        "Content": "The property comprises of a site contained in folio no. CE1215F, Cratloekeel, Co. Clare. \r\n\r\nWe understand that there is no planning currently on the site and that the mains water is situated approximately 100 metres from the site. \r\n\r\nThe property has a derelict warehouse/shed situated thereon and historically has had a grant of planning in the early 2000's.\r\n\r\nThe property is situated in Cratloekeel, Co. Clare. The site is opposite a property with the following eircode; V95 CXH0."
